 your own viewpoints and opinions as  well and i'll be interested to hear them  i think that it's something we need to  talk about more often and shouldn't be  afraid to talk about it  since inevitably the demographics are  changing and  it will affect our lives more and more  in the future and so with that  i want to give a thank out to my patreon  supporters who i'm incredibly grateful  for  and i hope you've learned something in  this video and thanks for listening

